  // hands and forearms; 400 (22 dice, ~130) the arms and the neck; 1000 (52 dice, ~310) cuts through the trunk and goes on
  // with what is left. Paired
  // seeds: bout b has seed 3000 + b at every Strength. Its twin without severance: the same spec with --severance-off (every
  // body contact stops the blade: the earlier build's harm). Cutting through into a second body contact needs the platform's
  // follow-through: without it a cut that goes on meets nothing more.
  "title": "Strength 15 to 1000 (newly Embraced) against a trained guard, matched, no shields: severance",
  "fighters": [
    { "name": "Christof", "template": "Christof", "weapon": "Rapier", "shield": false, "sheet": "sandbox.newly_embraced",
